WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand with feet hip-width apart, a slight bend in the knees.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hinge from the hips and fold forward, keeping the spine long.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Hook the first two fingers and thumb around each big toe.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Inhale to lift the chest halfway and lengthen the spine, exhale to fold deeper, elbows bending out to the sides.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Let the head hang heavy, release the toes, and roll up slowly to stand.
